\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459980/extras/508d458a40531b1b954d617cc2c4cfba.poster.avif?t=1754979809\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459980/extras/508d458a40531b1b954d617cc2c4cfba.webm?t=1754979809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Up and Get Ahead</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your hard earned cash and experience points to upgrade your arsenal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459980/extras/a0d5b3507537a5bead476070449ac437.poster.avif?t=1754979809\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459980/extras/a0d5b3507537a5bead476070449ac437.webm?t=1754979809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve a small variety of quest to finally reach your goal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note: Early Access\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At this point of time the game contains a storyline and all the features although the content is still incomplete.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
